WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:03.400
Everyone, Kaleido Star is about to start.

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:06.710
When you watch Kaleido Star,
please keep your room brightly lit,

00:00:06.780 --> 00:00:09.300
and sit as far from the TV as you can.

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:15.210
Well, well, well, do you have anything
you're doing with all your might?

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:17.940
I'm always in fighting spirits,

00:00:18.190 --> 00:00:19.850
but Miss Layla is more amazing than I am.

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:22.480
She is always thinking
how she can improve herself.

00:00:22.790 --> 00:00:24.430
Now, it's our show!

00:00:24.430 --> 00:00:28.160
I'll make sure I'll complete it
by all means. I will! I will!

00:00:42.540 --> 00:00:45.640
<i>What is it that you want to do?</i>

00:00:42.540 --> 00:00:45.640
<i>Yaritai koto wa nani</i>

00:00:46.150 --> 00:00:49.310
<i>Every time I was asked that</i>

00:00:46.150 --> 00:00:49.310
<i>Sou kikareru tabi</i>

00:00:50.020 --> 00:00:53.040
<i>I looked up at the blue sky</i>

00:00:50.020 --> 00:00:53.040
<i>Aoi sora miageta</i>

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:57.060
<i>The answer is only in my heart</i>

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:57.060
<i>Kotae wa only my heart</i>

00:00:57.060 --> 00:01:04.570
<i>I don't easily say the words
that are really important</i>

00:00:57.060 --> 00:01:04.570
<i>Honto ni daiji na kotoba wa
kantan ni wa iwanai</i>

00:01:04.570 --> 00:01:11.870
<i>I start running towards the place
the light points to</i>

00:01:04.570 --> 00:01:11.870
<i>Hikari ga yubisasu basho e to hashiridasu yo</i>

00:01:11.870 --> 00:01:19.820
<i>There's so much in my heart that I want
to embrace, I could cry</i>

00:01:11.870 --> 00:01:19.820
<i>Dakishimetai mono nara
nakitai hodo mune ni aru</i>

00:01:19.820 --> 00:01:26.790
<i>I'll keep painting my way, I promise,
take it someday</i>

00:01:19.820 --> 00:01:26.790
<i>Egakitsuzukete yuku kitto
take it someday</i>

00:01:26.790 --> 00:01:34.760
<i>Beyond the horizon, where the white
clouds drift</i>

00:01:26.790 --> 00:01:34.760
<i>Shiroi kumo ga nagareru
chiheisen no mukou ni</i>

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:46.500
<i>The future is lined up and
it'll always be there by my side</i>

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:46.500
<i>Naranderu mirai wa itsumo soba ni aru kara</i>

00:02:11.770 --> 00:02:13.320
I told you, you're too slow!

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:15.270
Yes. Sorry.

00:02:15.270 --> 00:02:17.140
Please, one more time.

00:02:17.270 --> 00:02:18.360
Hurry up.

00:02:18.710 --> 00:02:20.540
It looks tough.

00:02:20.540 --> 00:02:21.370
I know.

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:24.640
All right.

00:02:27.020 --> 00:02:29.110
Sorry. I was too early!

00:02:30.220 --> 00:02:32.690
One, two, three... One, two, three...

00:02:33.620 --> 00:02:34.680
Sorry.

00:02:36.020 --> 00:02:38.550
There is less than a week until opening day.

00:02:38.630 --> 00:02:41.720
Sora is too afraid of missing the timing.

00:02:42.330 --> 00:02:44.130
So, she becomes nervous,

00:02:44.130 --> 00:02:45.900
and it makes her miss the timing even more.

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:54.640
The Amazing Competition Calls Up A Storm

00:02:54.640 --> 00:02:57.580
The Amazing Competition Calls Up A Storm

00:02:54.640 --> 00:02:57.580
"The Amazing Competition Calls Up A Storm"

00:02:57.580 --> 00:03:00.340
The Amazing Competition Calls Up A Storm

00:03:02.520 --> 00:03:05.090
I don't know what Kalos is thinking.

00:03:05.090 --> 00:03:08.390
After all, you and she are like oil and water.

00:03:08.390 --> 00:03:09.360
It won't work out.

00:03:10.330 --> 00:03:14.590
He'll do anything in order to be
the topic of conversation.

00:03:15.330 --> 00:03:17.590
Aren't you both just being used by him?

00:03:18.970 --> 00:03:21.170
In order to make the show
somewhat presentable,

00:03:21.170 --> 00:03:23.300
you're the one who has to adjust to her.

00:03:25.410 --> 00:03:28.340
Whatever his intention is,
it's nothing to do with me.

00:03:29.510 --> 00:03:30.380
Really?

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:35.140
One, two, three. One, two, three.

00:03:35.580 --> 00:03:36.450
Sorry.

00:03:36.450 --> 00:03:37.880
You fell again.

00:03:38.550 --> 00:03:41.060
'Cause I can't adjust the timing.

00:03:41.060 --> 00:03:43.530
But if I try to watch Miss Layla's moves,

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:44.550
I fall behind.

00:03:45.130 --> 00:03:47.560
I am the one who has to
adjust the timing, but...

00:03:48.930 --> 00:03:50.000
Sora!

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:51.000
Yes!

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:52.130
You have a guest.

00:03:52.130 --> 00:03:54.070
What? A guest?

00:03:54.870 --> 00:03:55.670
Yes?

00:03:57.040 --> 00:03:57.810
Whoa...

00:03:57.810 --> 00:03:57.940
Whoa!

00:03:57.810 --> 00:03:57.940
Whoa...

00:03:57.940 --> 00:03:58.510
Whoa!

00:03:58.510 --> 00:04:00.130
Miss Layla... Excuse me...

00:04:00.540 --> 00:04:01.770
Well, bye, Layla.

00:04:01.880 --> 00:04:02.910
Thank you.

00:04:02.910 --> 00:04:04.110
Thanks...

00:04:04.110 --> 00:04:05.910
Um... I...

00:04:05.910 --> 00:04:07.970
I'm going to stay here for a while.

00:04:08.080 --> 00:04:09.280
What?

00:04:11.290 --> 00:04:12.220
Um...

00:04:12.220 --> 00:04:16.210
I asked Ken to video tape this
so I can get a feel for your timing.

00:04:16.560 --> 00:04:20.720
I came here so I can study
your rhythms and pauses.

00:04:21.900 --> 00:04:25.530
So, please try to learn
my moves and rhythms too.

00:04:25.730 --> 00:04:28.800
Your moves and rhythms...

00:04:28.800 --> 00:04:29.740
Yes.

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:36.870
She looks so cool.

00:04:36.950 --> 00:04:37.740
