00:04:45.790 --> 00:04:50.160
We eat dinner in the dining hall.
How about you, Miss Layla?

00:04:50.630 --> 00:04:51.680
I will have it with you.

00:04:51.960 --> 00:04:52.830
Sora!

00:04:52.830 --> 00:04:53.790
Let's go to the dining hall!

00:04:55.960 --> 00:04:56.860
