00:04:57.030 --> 00:04:58.230
Why is Miss Layla...

00:04:58.470 --> 00:05:01.270
Oh, she's going to live here a while.

00:05:01.270 --> 00:05:02.140
What!

00:05:02.140 --> 00:05:02.930
Let's go.

00:05:03.170 --> 00:05:04.310
If she is going to co-star,

00:05:04.310 --> 00:05:06.270
she should have chosen one of us.

00:05:06.510 --> 00:05:09.480
Like, if she chose me, it'd be almost perfect.

00:05:09.610 --> 00:05:11.040
Would you mind moving up?

00:05:11.210 --> 00:05:13.080
I haven't chosen my stuff yet.

00:05:13.350 --> 00:05:13.550
Bowwow!

00:05:13.550 --> 00:05:14.520
Meow!

00:05:13.550 --> 00:05:14.520
Bowwow!

00:05:30.530 --> 00:05:34.730
Even just walking, Miss Layla looks elegant.

00:05:38.170 --> 00:05:39.970
Shall I make you coffee?

00:05:40.040 --> 00:05:41.410
Don't worry about it.

00:05:41.410 --> 00:05:43.170
Instead, I will borrow your shower.

00:05:44.010 --> 00:05:45.480
She said "shower! "

00:05:45.480 --> 00:05:46.340
Are you sure?!

00:05:47.050 --> 00:05:47.840
