So, I changed it.

00:06:23.550 --> 00:06:23.690
Please change into this one!

00:06:23.690 --> 00:06:24.320
Rope!

00:06:23.690 --> 00:06:24.320
Please change into this one!

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:24.420
Please change into this one!

00:06:24.420 --> 00:06:25.220
Gah.

00:06:24.420 --> 00:06:25.220
Please change into this one!

00:06:25.790 --> 00:06:26.650
