00:06:32.230 --> 00:06:33.160
All right.

00:06:39.900 --> 00:06:42.870
Oh, Miss Layla, please use my bed.

00:06:42.870 --> 00:06:44.170
I'll sleep on the floor.

00:06:44.670 --> 00:06:46.660
I said, don't worry about it.

00:06:48.310 --> 00:06:49.330
Okay...

00:06:55.950 --> 00:06:58.350
Making Miss Layla do something like this,

00:06:58.350 --> 00:07:01.910
if I can't adjust my timing after this...

00:07:02.090 --> 00:07:04.690
No... I shouldn't think like this.

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:06.350
I have to make sure
I accomplish it by all means.

00:07:06.630 --> 00:07:08.260
Even her sleeping face is beautiful...

00:07:08.330 --> 00:07:09.850
Fool! When did you...

00:07:11.070 --> 00:07:13.300
I'm a little bit different today.

00:07:21.910 --> 00:07:22.740
The Tower...

00:07:23.240 --> 00:07:25.680
Unexpected things may happen.

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:29.740
Excuse me, but isn't Miss Layla's visit
here itself something unexpected?

00:07:30.220 --> 00:07:31.710
That's true.

00:07:32.550 --> 00:07:35.180
Fool, please don't wake up Miss Layla.

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:42.690
Miss Layla's moves.

00:07:43.360 --> 00:07:44.460
Miss Layla's pauses.

00:07:45.100 --> 00:07:46.190
Miss Layla's rhythms.

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:51.570
Quickly... I have to learn it quickly.

00:07:52.640 --> 00:07:53.170
Step in without hesitating!

00:07:53.170 --> 00:07:53.910
Step in without hesitating!

00:07:53.170 --> 00:07:53.910
They still can't get in tune when they have to.

00:07:53.910 --> 00:07:54.740
Yes!

00:07:53.910 --> 00:07:54.740
They still can't get in tune when they have to.

00:07:54.740 --> 00:07:55.870
They still can't get in tune when they have to.

00:07:55.980 --> 00:07:56.810
It's not enough!

00:07:56.810 --> 00:07:57.610
Yes!

00:07:58.910 --> 00:07:59.740
Too late!

00:08:00.110 --> 00:08:01.670
Sorry... Oh!

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:20.430
Hey, don't you think those two are
starting to get on the same wavelength?

00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:22.160
Sora's trying so hard...

00:08:27.710 --> 00:08:29.940
Their timing is starting to synchronize.

00:08:29.940 --> 00:08:31.710
I think they will be fine in the early scenes.

00:08:33.080 --> 00:08:37.140
But will they be able to endure the
performance at the climax?

00:09:00.070 --> 00:09:01.060
Jump!

00:09:02.110 --> 00:09:02.910
Oh, we're too close...

00:09:04.550 --> 00:09:06.980
I think we'll somehow be able
to open on the first day.

00:09:06.980 --> 00:09:08.080
However,

00:09:08.080 --> 00:09:12.950
I think it's better if we drop the difficulty
of the climax piece a little.

00:09:12.950 --> 00:09:15.690
Are you saying you want to make
the climax scene easy?

00:09:15.690 --> 00:09:16.620
Yes.

00:09:16.620 --> 00:09:20.630
For the time being, let's get rid
of the idea of using the diabolo.

00:09:20.630 --> 00:09:21.530
What?!

00:09:21.960 --> 00:09:26.030
Co-starring with a newcomer
is enough adventure in itself.

00:09:26.030 --> 00:09:27.240
As a director,

00:09:27.240 --> 00:09:29.100
I want to avoid any more adventures
than what we're doing right now.

00:09:29.370 --> 00:09:31.200
But, I worked hard for...

00:09:31.270 --> 00:09:32.830
I'm aware of that!

00:09:33.440 --> 00:09:34.710
But we don't have time.

00:09:34.710 --> 00:09:35.680
I will not accept it!

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:36.980
What?!

00:09:36.980 --> 00:09:38.040
But, Miss Layla...

00:09:38.480 --> 00:09:41.820
I cannot allow you to make the climax easy.

00:09:41.820 --> 00:09:43.280
Please give us tomorrow, one more day!

00:09:43.450 --> 00:09:46.850
Tomorrow is the general probe,
the dress rehearsal.

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:48.790
We already postponed until
tomorrow just for the two of you!

00:09:49.490 --> 00:09:51.290
We will use substitutes for the general probe.

00:09:51.990 --> 00:09:53.090
Are you serious?

00:09:53.360 --> 00:09:54.290
Of course I am.

00:09:54.500 --> 00:09:56.290
Thank you, Kalos.

00:09:57.870 --> 00:09:58.830
Sora...

00:09:58.830 --> 00:09:59.670
Ken...

00:09:59.670 --> 00:10:00.740
Where is Miss Layla?

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:03.100
She said she had some phone calls to make.

00:10:03.100 --> 00:10:04.010
I see.

00:10:04.010 --> 00:10:05.240
So, what did they say?

00:10:05.240 --> 00:10:06.510
Oh, yes...

00:10:06.510 --> 00:10:08.940
For the time being,
we get one more day, tomorrow.

00:10:08.940 --> 00:10:10.480
Really? That's good.

00:10:10.480 --> 00:10:12.250
Thank you. See you...

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:13.300
Sure...

00:10:15.080 --> 00:10:16.810
I'm sure you will do fine, Sora!

00:10:17.350 --> 00:10:19.250
Yes.

00:10:27.230 --> 00:10:28.800
Good morning. How is everything going?

00:10:28.800 --> 00:10:30.970
Good morning, Miss Layla.

00:10:30.970 --> 00:10:32.400
We somehow managed to do it.

00:10:32.630 --> 00:10:33.530
Thank you.

00:10:33.530 --> 00:10:34.400
Excuse me...

00:10:35.470 --> 00:10:37.000
Hurry and get on the boat.

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:37.900
Yes!

00:10:38.110 --> 00:10:40.800
It looks like the weather also
started cooperating.

00:10:41.010 --> 00:10:42.130
It looks that way.

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:46.710
"The weather started cooperating"?

00:10:50.920 --> 00:10:52.120
Excuse me...

00:10:52.120 --> 00:10:53.450
We're going to start special training.

00:10:53.450 --> 00:10:54.390
What?!

00:11:07.340 --> 00:11:10.000
Our timing was finally beginning to match...

00:11:10.370 --> 00:11:14.140
Will it be okay to practice over the real sea?

00:11:14.140 --> 00:11:16.580
Forget everything we have done
up to this point.

00:11:16.580 --> 00:11:17.450
What?

00:11:17.450 --> 00:11:22.210
I've also been working so hard,
just trying to adjust the timing.

00:11:22.280 --> 00:11:24.450
But no matter how many times I repeat
the same things like I've been doing,

00:11:24.450 --> 00:11:27.520
the final product will be a
safe and boring show.

00:11:27.520 --> 00:11:28.320
Miss Layla...

00:11:28.790 --> 00:11:31.320
This is a real fight between us.

00:11:32.060 --> 00:11:34.820
A real fight with Miss Layla?

00:11:35.130 --> 00:11:37.320
So, will you accept this challenge?

00:11:38.230 --> 00:11:39.200
Yes.

00:11:41.370 --> 00:11:42.740
Do you want a lifeline?

00:11:42.740 --> 00:11:44.110
I won't need one.

00:11:44.110 --> 00:11:45.570
It will get in my way when I move.

00:11:45.640 --> 00:11:46.870
I won't need it either.

00:11:47.010 --> 00:11:48.030
Really?

00:11:54.480 --> 00:11:57.540
You're beginning to look like a real enemy.

00:12:32.290 --> 00:12:33.860
She has such amazing spirit.

00:12:33.860 --> 00:12:35.350
If I lose my nerve even a little,

00:12:35.420 --> 00:12:37.390
she really is going to knock me in the sea.

00:12:37.590 --> 00:12:40.150
If you drop your guard, you will be shark bait.

00:12:52.640 --> 00:12:55.910
Over the real sea, no one can predict
the movement of the waves,

00:12:55.910 --> 00:12:57.000
not even Miss Layla...

00:13:01.680 --> 00:13:03.580
Yeah, that's right.

00:13:03.580 --> 00:13:06.550
They're supposed to doing special training
in the middle of the sea around this time.

00:13:06.550 --> 00:13:08.760
As for the rehearsal, please continue.

00:13:08.760 --> 00:13:11.420
The show will open as planned.

00:13:12.030 --> 00:13:13.290
Yeah.

00:13:15.560 --> 00:13:18.400
Miss Sarah, it's not your turn yet.

00:13:18.400 --> 00:13:20.630
I can't believe I did it. Sorry.

00:13:20.970 --> 00:13:23.800
That's right. Keep an eye on the space
in the front and the back!

00:13:23.800 --> 00:13:27.140
Dick! I think you should step forward there,
and let's try an ad-lib.

00:13:27.140 --> 00:13:27.940
Okay.

00:13:28.210 --> 00:13:29.680
Cruising?

00:13:29.680 --> 00:13:32.650
Opening day is tomorrow.
I wonder if they will be all right?

00:13:32.650 --> 00:13:35.410
I assume Miss Layla has
something on her mind.

00:13:35.850 --> 00:13:37.910
But, I'm worried about the weather.

00:13:50.360 --> 00:13:52.130
Amazing...

00:14:15.690 --> 00:14:17.890
Are you reaching your limit?

00:14:19.360 --> 00:14:20.380
No...

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:22.090
Really?

00:14:34.880 --> 00:14:36.480
Stop with all the noise!

00:14:36.480 --> 00:14:38.650
As long as you guys keep
standing there, it'll be fine!

00:14:38.650 --> 00:14:39.670
YES!

00:14:41.280 --> 00:14:42.380
Really...

00:14:42.380 --> 00:14:44.320
Can we really make
tomorrow's opening date?

00:15:04.870 --> 00:15:05.860
Miss Layla!

00:15:16.380 --> 00:15:17.480
I think we'll be all right.

00:15:20.860 --> 00:15:21.690
Yes!

00:15:26.630 --> 00:15:29.200
Since the seas in the direction
of the port are still rough,

00:15:29.200 --> 00:15:31.030
we will drop anchor here until morning.

00:15:31.030 --> 00:15:32.000
All right.

00:15:33.600 --> 00:15:35.300
So, tomorrow is finally a real show.

00:15:36.570 --> 00:15:37.540
In a real show...

00:15:37.740 --> 00:15:38.930
What?

00:15:39.410 --> 00:15:42.600
I wonder if they could have rain
in a real performance.

00:15:44.050 --> 00:15:47.050
You're truly amazing, Miss Layla.

00:15:47.050 --> 00:15:49.980
You're always thinking about Kaleido Stage.

00:15:54.160 --> 00:15:57.850
Miss Layla, why did you join Kaleido Stage?

00:15:58.560 --> 00:16:00.130
When I was a child,

00:16:00.130 --> 00:16:03.630
I saw Kaleido Stage with my parents.

00:16:03.630 --> 00:16:05.860
It was so wonderful. Like a dream.

00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:08.700
Of course, the show was wonderful,

00:16:08.700 --> 00:16:10.100
but I thought it was strange to see
my mother and father

00:16:10.100 --> 00:16:13.870
Laughing and being surprised as if
they were kids.

00:16:14.510 --> 00:16:16.100
Which show was it?

00:16:17.810 --> 00:16:19.400
Alice's Adventures in Wonderland.

00:16:20.820 --> 00:16:23.080
Alice's Adventures in Wonderland.

00:16:32.230 --> 00:16:37.720
The show I saw with my parents was also
Alice's Adventures in Wonderland.

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:45.540
But, of course, it became the last memory
that I had with both my parents.

00:16:45.540 --> 00:16:46.970
My mother, too...

00:16:47.540 --> 00:16:49.310
She has passed away,

00:16:49.310 --> 00:16:56.080
but it was my first and last time seeing my
mother surprised and laughing like that.

00:16:57.450 --> 00:17:04.020
After my mother died, my father devoted
himself to work to take his mind off of her.

00:17:06.890 --> 00:17:10.830
It would be nice if your father
could see you onstage this time.

00:17:11.670 --> 00:17:15.200
Oh... Did I say something I shouldn't have?

00:17:15.200 --> 00:17:16.100
No...

00:17:17.400 --> 00:17:21.810
I've never told this to anybody.

00:17:22.480 --> 00:17:26.810
This girl may possess a power that can
change her surroundings.

00:17:27.620 --> 00:17:31.750
Someday, the audience will come
here just to see her.

00:17:34.050 --> 00:17:35.450
Let's take a little rest.

00:17:35.620 --> 00:17:36.450
Yes.

00:17:36.520 --> 00:17:39.960
By the way, you talk a lot in your sleep.

00:17:40.230 --> 00:17:42.330
Oh... Do l?

00:17:42.330 --> 00:17:44.030
Talking in my sleep?

00:17:44.030 --> 00:17:46.470
Is she talking about the time
when I was talking to Fool?

00:17:47.870 --> 00:17:49.870
No way...

00:17:49.870 --> 00:17:53.470
They are not coming back today?

00:17:53.470 --> 00:17:54.570
Are they going to stay overnight?

00:17:55.040 --> 00:17:56.630
They never told me this.

00:17:58.110 --> 00:18:01.450
Something unexpected happened.

00:18:04.820 --> 00:18:06.190
I have no choice.

00:18:06.190 --> 00:18:08.120
I will wait one more night.

00:18:09.420 --> 00:18:12.590
You guys, please come back by tomorrow.

00:18:19.970 --> 00:18:21.170
It's me.

00:18:21.170 --> 00:18:23.500
Hm. I see.

00:18:23.500 --> 00:18:24.730
All right.

00:18:26.440 --> 00:18:27.470
It's me.

00:18:27.470 --> 00:18:29.700
We will start opening day as scheduled.

00:18:29.980 --> 00:18:33.210
Layla and Sora are heading here directly.

00:18:33.910 --> 00:18:35.520
They'll be here very soon.

00:18:35.520 --> 00:18:36.410
Let's go.

00:18:36.920 --> 00:18:38.580
Sora's coming back.

00:18:38.650 --> 00:18:40.480
I'm glad. They made it in time.

00:18:51.030 --> 00:18:52.000
There they are!

00:19:04.180 --> 00:19:05.240
Sora!

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:06.980
Welcome back!

00:19:12.190 --> 00:19:15.060
It's nice to have you back. Welcome back.

00:19:15.060 --> 00:19:17.320
Jean, I want you to prepare rain for us.

00:19:17.390 --> 00:19:18.360
Rain?

00:19:19.230 --> 00:19:20.490
All right. I'll try.

00:19:20.490 --> 00:19:21.630
Everyone, please come here.

00:19:21.630 --> 00:19:22.560
Yes.

00:19:22.560 --> 00:19:24.050
Welcome back.

00:19:24.130 --> 00:19:25.500
I'm back.

00:20:05.070 --> 00:20:06.510
She's faster than yesterday.

00:20:22.460 --> 00:20:23.420
Amazing...

00:20:23.520 --> 00:20:25.420
